</p><p data-structure="Facts" id="p_13">10.	Thus substantial amount was deposited by petitioner in respect to the dues disputed in the above three writ petitions. There were all dismissed in the year 2003 by Lucknow Bench of this Court. Interest payable on the late deposit of above amount which came to around Rs. 18,09,637/- remained unpaid. Executive Engineer found total dues against petitioner in respect of aforesaid three writ petitions and that accruing subsequently as on November, 2008, as under:-
